    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kirworiut Esekia ka Isaya ŋakiro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iirari Esekia ŋakiro ŋun, tocilicili ŋilowi keŋ tonap ŋiguniyae, tolot Kai ke Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu iŋes kiyakiya Eliakim ŋolo apolokinit akai ŋina ke erwosit ka Sebina ekegirigiran ta ŋisacaradotin ŋulu apolok. Anapito ŋul daadaŋ ŋiguniyae, ido apotu toloto neni a ekadwaran Isaya a lokoku ka Amos. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimokis ikes Isaya temasi, “Ebala Esekia, erae akoloŋit na ŋina a ŋican, ŋina a akiŋenyakinet ta ŋileec. Ikoni neni ani edoli akidoun ikoku todaun aberu agogoŋu ŋinakidinyakinet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acepaki iiraarit Ekapolon ŋolo erae Akuj kon ŋakiro ŋuna erwor ekapolokiniton ejie a ŋasigarya ka Asiriya, ŋolo iyakuunitae aneni ke erwosit a ŋolo ka Asiriya akiyany Akuj ŋina eyari. Elipi ayoŋ kiira Ekapolon Akuj kon ŋiyany ŋul, ido kisican ŋulu apotu tolimut ŋiyany ŋul. Aŋun, kilip neni ka Akuj kon aŋuna a ŋituŋa yok a ŋulu idoŋito ne.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edolunete ŋituŋa ŋulu eyakiunit Esekia neni ka Isaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abu Isaya tolimok tema, “Tolimokisi ekapolon kus ebe ebala Ekapolon, ‘Nyikibul aŋuna idau iyoŋ akiirar, nyikibul a ŋakiro a ŋuna ekeyanyitotor ayoŋ ŋituŋa ŋulu iyakuunit erwosit ŋolo ka Asiriya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiira, abuni ayoŋ elope akisiirar erwosit ka Asiriya ŋakiro ŋuna itorotokinete iŋes toboŋo nakwap keŋ, ido ani edoli iŋes inaa, etaari ayoŋ ŋituŋa iŋes.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kitubul Senakerib ŋituŋa a Yudaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ekapolokiniton ejie a ŋasigarya ka Asiriya kiira atemar arotoki erwosit ka Asiriya alo Lakis akitijiore ŋituŋa ŋulu ke etaun a Libina a ŋolo edunyasi ka Lakis, aŋun, abu iŋes tolot Libina aanyun erwosit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin abu Senakerib ŋolo arae erwosit ka Asiriya kiira atemar ebunit Ekusait ŋolo enyaraitae Tiraka ŋolo arae erwosit a Ijipit akitijiore iŋes. Aŋun, abu nabo iŋes kiyakiya ŋituŋa neni ke Esekia a ŋolo ayai Yudaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alimokin iŋes ebe, “Nyicamak Akuj ŋina ikinyomit iyoŋ ikimodikini iyoŋ ebela, ‘Nyipotokinio Yerusalem napedor ŋina ke erwosit ka Asiriya.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kire, idau iyoŋ akiiranar ŋuna apotu ŋirwosi ka Asiriya kitiyata nakwapin daadaŋ, apotu jik tomunyasi. Ikilakunio mono kire iyoŋ a? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu koloŋ atapapaa kosi kinyasut ŋitaunio Gosan ka Aran ta Resep, tosodo tomunyasi ŋituŋa ŋulu a Eden ŋulu alomito Telasar. Mam ŋakujo kec ŋuna apotu tolakut ikes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ai eriŋa eyakasi ŋirwosi ŋulu a ŋitaunio a ŋulu anyaritae Amas, Arapad, Separabaim ka Ena ta Ipa?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akilip ŋina ke Esekia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Esekia torukau abaruwa ŋina eyakikinitae iŋes ŋina ayaunete ŋituŋa a Senakerib, tosodi tosyom. Ani irikakini akisyom, abu iŋes tolot Kai ka Akuj, toŋaa abaruwa alokiŋaren Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilip Esekia neni ke Ekapolon tema, “Okoe Ekapolon ŋolo irae Akuj a Ŋisirael. Iyoŋ ŋolo iboi alokicoloŋ a ŋolo alokidiŋ Ŋikerubim. Iyoŋ bon irae Akuj a ŋakwapin a daadaŋ. Iyoŋ ibu tosub nakuj ka akwap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okoe Ekapolon, topupok ka kiira; toŋaa ŋakonyen kon, Okoe Ekapolon kiŋolik, ido topupok ŋakiro ŋuna irworit Senakerib ikiyanyit iyoŋ Akuj ŋina iyari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okoe Ekapolon, kire ikiyeni isua atemar enyasut ŋirwosi ŋulu ka Asiriya ŋituŋa a ŋakwapin ka eturuwosi ŋakiboisyo kec ŋakoŋinae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adaut ikes akicunyakin ŋakujo kec ka amunaasi, anerae pa arae ikes ŋakujo nai arae ŋakito ka ŋamoru ŋuna etiyaunitae erae ŋakujo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tokona Ekapolon, iyoŋ ŋolo irae Akuj kosi, tolakunae isua aneni a Senakerib, ikotere toyenut ŋakwapin a daadaŋ atemar iyoŋ bon irae Akuj.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tosodi nai Isaya lokoku ka Amos kiyakiya akirot neni ke Esekia tema, “Ebala Ekapolon ŋolo erae Akuj a Ŋisirael ebe: Adau ayoŋ akiirar akilip ŋina ilip iyoŋ neni keŋ aŋuna a Senakerib a erwosit ka Asiriya ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋakiro ŋuna adau Ekapolon Akuj akirwor aŋuna keŋ ikes nu:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
